After careful consideration, we have decided to move our Early Access release to September 2025.
During the final submission process, we identified a critical issue related to localization and save-game behavior. Rather than releasing with such a bug, we’ve chosen to delay the public launch in order to deliver a more stable experience.
[p align="start"]✨ Over the next weeks we will:

squash the localization/save bug;

run a small closed testing round (keys will be sent to selected testers);

polish the UI & stability;

finalize our content roadmap for Early Access updates.
[p align="start"]🎯 New target window: mid-late September 2025.
[p align="start"]Thank you for your patience, wishlist support, and all the kind words — it really keeps us going.
See you at the terminal soon! 🚢📦
